#: lib/Pages.php
msgid "Redfish Health"
msgstr "Kesehatan Redfish"

#: lib/Settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s Default %d, from %d to %d."
msgstr "%s Default %d, dari %d hingga %d."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Credential Vault"
msgstr "Brankas Kredensial"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Vault Key File"
msgstr "Berkas Kunci Brankas"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to the 32-byte key that encrypts stored BMC passwords. Create it yourself, outside the web root, readable only by the web server and poller user, in a directory that only root and that user can write; the plugin never creates or writes it. Back it up with the database: without it, stored passwords must be entered again."
msgstr "Jalur absolut ke kunci 32-byte yang mengenkripsi kata sandi BMC tersimpan. Buat kunci ini sendiri, di luar root web, hanya dapat dibaca oleh server web dan pengguna poller, di dalam direktori yang hanya dapat ditulis oleh root dan pengguna tersebut; plugin tidak pernah membuat atau menulisnya. Cadangkan bersama basis data: tanpanya, kata sandi tersimpan harus dimasukkan kembali."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collector"
msgstr "Pengumpul"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collection Interval"
msgstr "Interval Pengumpulan"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds between reads of each BMC."
msgstr "Detik di antara pembacaan setiap BMC."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Rediscovery Interval"
msgstr "Interval Penemuan Ulang"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds between full resource discoveries of each BMC. A BMC is also rediscovered at once when a known resource disappears or changes type."
msgstr "Detik di antara penemuan sumber daya penuh pada setiap BMC. BMC juga akan langsung ditemukan ulang ketika sumber daya yang diketahui menghilang atau berubah jenis."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collector Time Budget"
msgstr "Anggaran Waktu Pengumpul"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one collector run may spend before it stops starting new BMCs. Keep it below the poller interval; unfinished BMCs resume on the next run."
msgstr "Detik yang boleh digunakan satu proses kolektor sebelum berhenti memulai BMC baru. Pertahankan di bawah interval poller; BMC yang belum selesai akan dilanjutkan pada proses berikutnya."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "BMCs read in parallel. Each BMC is read by one worker at a time."
msgstr "BMC yang dibaca secara paralel. Setiap BMC dibaca oleh satu worker pada satu waktu."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collector Workers"
msgstr "Worker Kolektor"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Connect Timeout"
msgstr "Batas Waktu Koneksi"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds allowed for the TCP connection and TLS handshake to a BMC."
msgstr "Detik yang diizinkan untuk koneksi TCP dan jabat tangan TLS ke BMC."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Request Timeout"
msgstr "Batas Waktu Permintaan"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds allowed for one whole request to a BMC, including the connection."
msgstr "Detik yang diizinkan untuk satu permintaan penuh ke BMC, termasuk koneksinya."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "KiB accepted in one BMC response body; a larger response is refused."
msgstr "KiB yang diterima dalam satu isi respons BMC; respons yang lebih besar akan ditolak."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Maximum Response Size"
msgstr "Ukuran Respons Maksimum"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Freshness"
msgstr "Kesegaran"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collection intervals after which a reading is shown as delayed."
msgstr "Interval pengumpulan yang setelahnya pembacaan ditampilkan sebagai tertunda."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Delayed After"
msgstr "Tertunda Setelah"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collection intervals after which a reading is stale and reads as unknown. Always at least one more than Delayed After."
msgstr "Interval pengumpulan yang setelahnya pembacaan dianggap usang dan terbaca sebagai tidak diketahui. Selalu minimal satu lebih banyak daripada Tertunda Setelah."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Stale After"
msgstr "Kedaluwarsa Setelah"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Copot Pemasangan"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Pertahankan Tabel Plugin saat Pencopotan"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its BMC registry, encrypted passwords, and reading cache. Clear it to have the uninstall drop them. Uninstall never touches Cacti devices, graphs, or BMCs, including devices the plugin created."
msgstr "Jika dicentang, menghapus instalasi plugin akan tetap menyimpan registri BMC, kata sandi terenkripsi, dan singgahan pembacaannya. Hapus centang agar penghapusan instalasi ikut menghapus data tersebut. Penghapusan instalasi tidak pernah menyentuh perangkat Cacti, grafik, atau BMC, termasuk perangkat yang dibuat oleh plugin."

#: lib/TlsMode.php
msgid "Verify against the system CA store"
msgstr "Verifikasi terhadap penyimpanan CA sistem"

#: lib/TlsMode.php
msgid "Verify against a CA bundle file"
msgstr "Verifikasi terhadap berkas bundel CA"

#: lib/TlsMode.php
msgid "Pinned public key (SHA-256)"
msgstr "Kunci publik tersemat (SHA-256)"

#: lib/TlsMode.php
msgid "Do not verify (unsafe)"
msgstr "Jangan verifikasi (tidak aman)"

#: redfish_bmcs.php
msgid "You do not have access to the Cacti device of this BMC."
msgstr "Anda tidak memiliki akses ke perangkat Cacti dari BMC ini."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
msgid "The BMC could not be saved."
msgstr "BMC tidak dapat disimpan."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
msgid "The BMC was saved."
msgstr "BMC berhasil disimpan."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
msgid "The BMC and its cached data were deleted. Its Cacti device was left in place."
msgstr "BMC dan data singgahannya telah dihapus. Perangkat Cacti-nya tetap dipertahankan."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
msgid "Backoff and held failures were cleared; the collector reads the BMC on its next run."
msgstr "Backoff dan kegagalan yang ditahan telah dibersihkan; kolektor akan membaca BMC pada proses berikutnya."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
msgid "Adding devices and graphs needs Cacti's device management permission."
msgstr "Menambahkan perangkat dan grafik memerlukan izin pengelolaan perangkat Cacti."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
msgid "The device of this BMC was deleted. Choose another device, or none, on the BMC form first."
msgstr "Perangkat dari BMC ini telah dihapus. Pilih perangkat lain, atau tidak ada, pada formulir BMC terlebih dahulu."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
#, php-format
msgid "The data queries were indexed again and %d graphs were added."
msgstr "Kueri data telah diindeks ulang dan %d grafik ditambahkan."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
msgid "The device was created with its Redfish graphs."
msgstr "Perangkat berhasil dibuat beserta grafik Redfish-nya."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
msgid "Installing the Redfish templates needs Cacti's Import Templates permission."
msgstr "Menginstal templat Redfish memerlukan izin Impor Templat Cacti."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
msgid "The Redfish templates are installed."
msgstr "Templat Redfish telah terinstal."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
msgid "The Redfish templates could not be installed. The health page shows why."
msgstr "Templat Redfish tidak dapat diinstal. Halaman kesehatan menampilkan penyebabnya."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
msgid "The import could not be saved; nothing was imported."
msgstr "Impor tidak dapat disimpan; tidak ada yang diimpor."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d BMCs were imported."
msgstr "%d BMC berhasil diimpor."

#: redfish_credentials.php
msgid "This credential is used by a BMC on a Cacti device you do not have access to, so it cannot be changed here."
msgstr "Kredensial ini digunakan oleh BMC pada perangkat Cacti yang tidak dapat Anda akses, sehingga tidak dapat diubah di sini."

#: redfish_credentials.php
msgid "Name: another credential already uses this name."
msgstr "Nama: kredensial lain sudah menggunakan nama ini."

#: redfish_credentials.php
msgid "User Name: enter 1 to 255 characters without control characters."
msgstr "Nama Pengguna: masukkan 1 hingga 255 karakter tanpa karakter kontrol."

#: redfish_credentials.php
msgid "Password: enter the password of the BMC account."
msgstr "Kata Sandi: masukkan kata sandi akun BMC."

#: redfish_credentials.php
#, php-format
msgid "The credential was saved, but the password was not stored: %s"
msgstr "Kredensial berhasil disimpan, tetapi kata sandi tidak disimpan: %s"

#: redfish_credentials.php
msgid "The credential could not be saved."
msgstr "Kredensial tidak dapat disimpan."

#: redfish_credentials.php
msgid "The credential was saved."
msgstr "Kredensial berhasil disimpan."

#: redfish_credentials.php
msgid "The credential and its stored password were deleted."
msgstr "Kredensial beserta kata sandi tersimpannya telah dihapus."

#: redfish_credentials.php
msgid "The credential was not deleted. A credential in use by a BMC cannot be deleted."
msgstr "Kredensial tidak dihapus. Kredensial yang sedang digunakan oleh BMC tidak dapat dihapus."

#: redfish_operator.php
msgid "Retry collection"
msgstr "Coba ulang pengumpulan"

#: redfish_operator.php
